#: includes/class-settings.php:265
msgid "Every class the widget uses is listed in the plugin’s readme, so a developer can override anything a preset does not cover."
msgstr "Svaka klasa koju widget koristi navedena je u datoteci readme dodatka, tako da razvojni programer može nadjačati sve što unaprijed postavljena postavka ne pokriva."

